specs/021-strata-inference-research/plan.md:9:Agentix owns the model loader, execution graph, scheduler, memory accounting, expert placement, caches, tokenizer integration and lifecycle. Use Rust 2021 for orchestration and independently sourced compute primitives or original kernels behind an isolated native boundary. Do not reimplement an entire arithmetic library without evidence that existing primitives are insufficient.
